<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu end-Aug derivatives position.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu end-Aug derivatives position.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish mining and metals group Outokumpu Oy on Monday detailed the following derivatives position:</p>
<p>Open derivative financial instruments contract amounts (million markka):</p>
<p>						   Aug 31 '96    Aug 31 '95</p>
<p>Forward foreign exchange</p>
<p> sales and purchases			    9,200	   9,800</p>
<p> Currency swaps				     390	     640</p>
<p> Interest rates swaps			     880	     860</p>
<p> Forward rate agreements			1,480	     120</p>
<p>Price fixing of mine production:</p>
<p>Forward copper sale contracts</p>
<p>33,540 tonnes for average price of</p>
<p>  $1.13/lb					    370	     480</p>
<p>Forward nickel sale contracts</p>
<p>420 tonnes for average price of</p>
<p>  $4.10/lb					     20		30</p>
<p>Purchased copper put option contracts</p>
<p>20,000 tonnes for average price of</p>
<p>  $0.95/lb					    190	     610</p>
<p>Forward metal sales and purchases</p>
<p>relating to offset hedging of</p>
<p> metal production and fabrication	     950	     700</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
